WEBVTT

00:10.920 --> 00:12.710
This is how I'll become...

00:15.580 --> 00:17.460
This is how I'll become...

00:19.460 --> 00:20.960
...Supreme Commander.

00:21.540 --> 00:22.710
... a hero.

00:23.250 --> 00:24.920
This is my story!

01:57.750 --> 01:59.580
<b>Caretaker</b>

01:57.750 --> 01:59.580
<b>Yuuki</b>

01:57.750 --> 01:59.580
<b>Wakura</b>

02:00.130 --> 02:02.130
Perfect! Squeaky clean!

02:00.250 --> 02:03.960
<b>Curiosity, Shushu, Undress</b>

02:02.130 --> 02:04.960
A job well done truly is its own reward!

02:06.170 --> 02:09.790
Too bad about the location.
It's not exactly pleasant...

02:18.000 --> 02:19.290
The barrier!

02:19.460 --> 02:23.250
I-I guess the Shuuki can show up
close to the dorm, too...

02:23.960 --> 02:26.290
Are you okay, Mr. Yuuki?

02:26.290 --> 02:28.630
H-hello, Nei. Welcome home.

02:29.040 --> 02:33.000
The 7th Squadron is in Mato's
unlucky southwest Urakimon area.

02:33.000 --> 02:36.630
That's why more Shuuki appear here
than at the other dorms.

02:37.170 --> 02:38.580
"Urakimon"?

02:38.580 --> 02:43.540
So, Mato is an alternate dimension
that's as big as the city of Tokyo.

02:43.540 --> 02:50.210
<b>1</b>

02:43.540 --> 02:50.210
<b>9</b>

02:43.540 --> 02:50.210
<b>3</b>

02:43.540 --> 02:50.210
<b>8</b>

02:43.540 --> 02:50.210
<b>5</b>

02:43.550 --> 02:50.210
<b>7</b>

02:43.550 --> 02:50.210
<b>6</b>

02:43.550 --> 02:50.210
<b>2</b>

02:43.550 --> 02:50.210
<b>10</b>

02:43.750 --> 02:46.290
It's divided up into eight different directions,

02:46.290 --> 02:49.670
and each one has its own
Demon Defense Force stationed there.

02:50.460 --> 02:52.830
We skip over "four" since it's a bad omen.

02:53.130 --> 02:54.540
I see...

02:54.540 --> 02:56.420
You're a lifesaver, Nei.

02:56.420 --> 02:59.960
I'm still completely clueless
when it comes to Mato.

03:00.710 --> 03:04.130
Nei's your senpai. It's her job to teach you!

03:05.290 --> 03:08.790
Not sure I'll ever get used to a child
having seniority over me...

03:09.460 --> 03:12.170
By the way, should we do something about that?

03:12.290 --> 03:17.380
That one's just a small fry.
I think we can safely ignore it.

03:17.380 --> 03:18.210
But-

03:22.670 --> 03:23.580
Hey!

03:25.130 --> 03:28.420
Chit-chatting instead of working,
Yuuki Wakura?

03:28.710 --> 03:31.130
What if you'd hit one of us with that?!

03:31.130 --> 03:33.670
Don't underestimate my skills.

03:33.960 --> 03:36.630
If I wanted to hit you,
you'd have a bullet in your skull.

03:36.790 --> 03:39.080
You're missing the point here...

03:39.250 --> 03:41.920
Now run along and go get dinner ready.

03:41.920 --> 03:43.290
Yeah, yeah...

03:43.290 --> 03:45.130
What's with the attitude?!

03:45.750 --> 03:47.580
You ought to be grateful!

03:47.580 --> 03:51.500
The only reason a man like you
has the privilege of living in our dorm

03:51.500 --> 03:54.460
and eating our food...

03:54.460 --> 03:56.920
is because of the commander's generosity!

03:57.460 --> 03:59.630
Being a caretaker sucks!

03:59.630 --> 04:00.710
Let's go.

04:03.420 --> 04:04.670
Is someone...?

04:05.750 --> 04:07.330
Must be my imagination.

04:12.250 --> 04:15.960
You really are a talented chef, Mr. Caretaker!

04:15.960 --> 04:17.920
D'aww!

04:17.920 --> 04:22.330
I'm not a picky eater, but I am glad
we're all getting nutritionally balanced meals.

04:22.670 --> 04:25.500
I'll have seconds... I suppose...

04:25.500 --> 04:27.880
Can you teach Nei how to cook, too?

04:29.630 --> 04:32.880
Keep up the good work
when you do the dishes and clean the tub.

04:32.880 --> 04:35.380
Same goes for cleaning
the spare rooms and the watchtower.

04:35.380 --> 04:36.330
Got it!

04:39.630 --> 04:40.880
Wait a second!

04:40.880 --> 04:44.830
I wanted to be a hero!
Now I'm just a frickin' handyman!

04:45.290 --> 04:47.960
Um, Miss Kyouka?

04:48.750 --> 04:52.290
We had discussed
me assisting you out in the field,

04:52.290 --> 04:55.830
but I feel like doing chores
is my main responsibility nowadays.

04:56.420 --> 04:58.710
I'll use you when you're needed.

04:58.710 --> 05:02.250
Until that time comes, you're free to
concentrate on your housekeeping tasks.

05:02.250 --> 05:03.210
No, I-

05:06.420 --> 05:10.380
I know you're not stupid enough to
complain about the commander's orders. Right?

05:10.380 --> 05:12.630
Her arm turns into a sword, too?!

05:13.540 --> 05:15.420
This is an all-girls dorm.

05:15.420 --> 05:19.380
I have no doubt that some of you
are uncomfortable with a male caretaker.

05:19.630 --> 05:23.830
But he's a skilled housekeeper,
and he's essential for my ability.

05:24.080 --> 05:26.330
So please, try to treat him kindly.

05:27.210 --> 05:28.290
If...

05:28.920 --> 05:33.750
he misbehaves or screws up,
I'll do my duty as his master and twist it off.

05:34.250 --> 05:35.630
Is that acceptable?

05:35.630 --> 05:36.790
Yes, ma'am.

05:37.380 --> 05:38.960
Twist WHAT off...?

05:46.130 --> 05:47.170
Nei!

05:47.710 --> 05:49.500
I'm going to hop in the bath!

05:50.290 --> 05:51.420
Okey-dokey!

05:56.670 --> 05:58.130
Wha-?!

06:06.000 --> 06:07.830
That scared the crap outta me!

06:07.830 --> 06:09.330
You peeked!

06:10.420 --> 06:12.580
I thought I heard Shushu's voice just now...

06:13.040 --> 06:14.460
I'm up here.

06:15.630 --> 06:18.750
So ya finally let your true colors show,
Mr. Caretaker.

06:19.000 --> 06:20.170
Shushu?!

06:20.420 --> 06:21.830
Surprised?

06:24.830 --> 06:28.460
My ability lets me grow AND shrink.

06:30.880 --> 06:31.790
Huh?

06:32.750 --> 06:34.380
Wh-what was that?

06:34.380 --> 06:37.380
I've been keepin'
a close eye on you, Mr. Caretaker.

06:37.380 --> 06:40.380
Y'see, I wanted to know
what makes a man tick.

06:40.630 --> 06:42.040
And looky here!

06:42.040 --> 06:43.960
Picture perfect, amirite?!

06:45.420 --> 06:47.080
I-it's not what it looks like!

06:47.420 --> 06:49.880
I wonder what the commander's going to think...

06:49.880 --> 06:51.500
Think she'll twist it off?

06:51.500 --> 06:53.750
A-are you threatening me?!

06:53.750 --> 06:55.880
What do you want?! Money?!

06:55.880 --> 06:58.130
I just like to keep things interesting!

06:58.420 --> 07:01.000
So if you don't want me to leak this photo...

07:01.000 --> 07:04.960
you'll have to be my slave, Mr. Caretaker.

07:04.960 --> 07:08.170
I already AM a slave...!

07:10.670 --> 07:11.750
Ugh...

07:11.750 --> 07:15.170
Romance manga
just doesn't do it for me, y'know?

07:11.750 --> 07:13.920
<b>'Cause I'm</b>

07:11.750 --> 07:13.920
<b>in love with you</b>

07:11.750 --> 07:13.920
<b>N-no way...</b>

07:15.170 --> 07:18.170
The action-adventure stuff
gets me more amped up.

07:19.250 --> 07:20.830
Don'tcha agree?

07:20.830 --> 07:22.250
Mr. Caretaker?

07:23.330 --> 07:24.330
Sure...

07:24.880 --> 07:27.290
Yeah, I figured as much.

07:27.290 --> 07:31.210
<b>No way...</b>

07:27.290 --> 07:31.210
<b>I mean it...</b>

07:27.540 --> 07:31.250
If I don't delete that photo on her phone,

07:31.250 --> 07:33.250
she's going to bully me
for the rest of my life.

07:35.710 --> 07:37.170
I'm bored.

07:37.290 --> 07:38.170
Now's my chance!

07:42.380 --> 07:46.290
What a naughty slave,
holding something like that.

07:46.290 --> 07:47.170
Huh?

07:52.040 --> 07:53.710
Oh, what's this?

07:53.960 --> 07:58.790
Aw, you're as red as a tomato, Mr. Caretaker.

08:00.170 --> 08:02.210
Y-you did that on purpose!

08:03.380 --> 08:06.500
You're predictable AND funny!

08:06.500 --> 08:09.710
Okay, but... th-those things...

08:09.710 --> 08:13.170
You're fine with me touching them?
Like, as a girl.

08:13.170 --> 08:16.000
I'd be creeped out if ya did somethin' weird,

08:16.000 --> 08:19.420
but I don't really think of you as a guy.

08:19.420 --> 08:22.420
If anything, you're more like...
a neat little pet?

08:22.420 --> 08:23.500
A pet?

08:23.880 --> 08:27.290
Besides, you're our housekeeper!

08:27.290 --> 08:30.210
And that's just another piece of clothing
for you to tidy up, right?

08:30.210 --> 08:32.750
So you're free to touch 'em all ya like!

08:34.580 --> 08:36.380
Then I'll organize these-

08:38.080 --> 08:40.630
I can use that as blackmail material, too!

08:40.630 --> 08:42.380
Quit taking photos of me!

08:43.380 --> 08:47.080
Still, the whole photo thing was an accident.

08:47.380 --> 08:50.750
Even if she rats me out to Miss Kyouka,
maybe I won't get in trouble.

08:51.460 --> 08:53.040
It's coming from outside?

08:53.170 --> 08:54.880
You have to move faster, Himari!

08:56.000 --> 08:57.790
Don't give the enemy a chance to attack!

08:57.790 --> 08:58.670
Yes, ma'am!

08:59.170 --> 09:01.920
The impact won't be strong enough
to slay a Shuuki,

09:01.920 --> 09:04.580
but it's an easy way to throw them off balance!

09:04.880 --> 09:09.170
To be effective, you must always
be swift, brutal, and sharp!

09:11.670 --> 09:12.880
A Shuuki!

09:13.750 --> 09:14.750
Watch closely.

09:25.380 --> 09:27.330
That's how you perform a combo.

09:27.500 --> 09:30.540
And without using your ability!
You're amazing, Commander!

09:30.540 --> 09:33.630
An insta-kill! I'm so screwed...

09:33.630 --> 09:36.250
I can't risk giving Miss Kyouka
the wrong impression!

09:37.040 --> 09:38.630
Oh... Hi, Nei.

09:38.630 --> 09:40.710
I have news for you as your senpai!

09:40.880 --> 09:42.460
I'm all ears.

09:42.460 --> 09:46.630
The commander, Miss Himari, and Nei will be
leaving the dorm to attend a meeting soon,

09:46.630 --> 09:49.130
so keep an eye on things with Miss Shushu
while we're gone, okay?

09:49.130 --> 09:50.540
With Shushu?!

09:50.540 --> 09:52.960
Miss Shushu is a really nice person,

09:52.960 --> 09:56.750
so I think it'll be a good opportunity
for you to get to know her better!

09:57.880 --> 10:00.830
That is NOT the face of a "nice person."

10:03.540 --> 10:05.460
That feels fantastic...

10:05.460 --> 10:09.830
Perfect for soothing my achy
muscles after an intense training session...

10:10.290 --> 10:11.380
Ow-ow-ow... Oh yeah... Right there...

10:11.380 --> 10:14.080
Why am I letting her walk all over me?!
Ow-ow-ow... Oh yeah... Right there...<b></b>

10:14.080 --> 10:17.040
I've gotta put my foot down once and for all!
Ow-ow-ow... Oh yeah... Right there...<b></b>

10:17.040 --> 10:17.580
Ow-ow-ow... Oh yeah... Right there...

10:19.290 --> 10:19.580
Oof, that's sore!

10:19.580 --> 10:20.880
O-or I could keep it up for a little longer...
Oof, that's sore!<b></b>

10:20.880 --> 10:23.080
O-or I could keep it up for a little longer...

10:23.080 --> 10:25.960
Hey, how'd you get so good
at shoulder massages?

10:26.500 --> 10:29.750
I used to give them to my big sister,
so I had lots of practice.

10:29.750 --> 10:32.420
So you've got a big sister, too!

10:32.420 --> 10:33.920
What about you, Shushu?

10:33.920 --> 10:36.670
I'm the youngest of three sisters
in my family!

10:37.000 --> 10:40.500
I grew up without a dad,
and I went to all-girls schools my whole life,

10:40.500 --> 10:43.250
so I'd never talked to a guy before.

10:43.420 --> 10:45.710
That's why you thought I was strange?

10:45.710 --> 10:48.250
I was watching your EVERY move.

10:48.250 --> 10:52.670
And then I decided to turn you into my slave
'cause it seemed like fun!

10:52.670 --> 10:54.580
Do you realize how crazy that sounds?!

10:54.790 --> 10:56.130
Maybe so...

10:56.130 --> 10:59.540
But having fun is what matters most,
in my opinion.

10:59.670 --> 11:02.960
It's why I moved to Mato.
I was lookin' for excitement.

11:02.960 --> 11:05.750
That's your reason?
Even though you could die?

11:05.750 --> 11:08.580
Sure! Slayin' Shuuki is a blast!

11:08.580 --> 11:11.380
It's like I'm the protagonist
of an adventure manga!

11:13.130 --> 11:15.080
My shoulders feel so much better...

11:15.540 --> 11:17.500
Now let's play a fighting game!

11:17.500 --> 11:19.040
O-okay...

11:19.040 --> 11:21.750
But you should know...
I'm pretty good at video games.

11:21.750 --> 11:23.750
Then why don't we spice things up?

11:23.920 --> 11:26.880
Loser has to strip off a piece of their clothing.

11:26.880 --> 11:28.500
What?! But...

11:28.500 --> 11:31.960
Obviously, slaves don't have
the right to refuse...

11:33.500 --> 11:35.750
F-fine, bring it on!

11:36.130 --> 11:38.790
I'll beat her and then force her to apologize!

11:38.790 --> 11:40.290
K.O.!

11:42.040 --> 11:43.380
K.O.!

11:44.670 --> 11:46.040
K.O.!

11:48.960 --> 11:50.750
You win!

11:52.040 --> 11:54.710
Too easy, Mr. Caretaker!

11:54.710 --> 11:55.960
But...

11:55.960 --> 12:00.500
my friends won't even let me play as Guile
'cause I always end up kicking their asses.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.920
C'mon, time to get naked.

12:03.130 --> 12:06.000
If I take off my underwear,
I'll be committing a crime...

12:06.000 --> 12:08.880
Nah, we're in Mato...
It's not that big a deal.

12:09.080 --> 12:14.000
I've never seen a guy naked before,
so I gotta admit, I'm kinda curious!

12:14.000 --> 12:16.830
B-but I'm a MAN, remember?!

12:16.830 --> 12:18.830
What if I start feeling frisky?

12:18.830 --> 12:20.380
It's not safe, Shushu...

12:20.380 --> 12:21.540
You could get hurt!

12:21.540 --> 12:22.790
Not safe?

12:23.130 --> 12:26.250
You oughtta trust your gut
when there's danger involved!

12:32.040 --> 12:34.960
THAT'S what you were worried about?!
What a gentleman!

12:38.580 --> 12:40.170
I'll be totally fine.

12:40.170 --> 12:42.750
I'd never let a man take advantage of me.

12:43.000 --> 12:45.710
I forgot about her ability!

12:45.710 --> 12:48.670
YOU'RE the one who's in danger here.

12:48.830 --> 12:49.710
Hey!

12:50.710 --> 12:52.710
Wait a second, you idiot!

12:52.710 --> 12:54.130
No can do!

12:55.670 --> 12:58.210
Now that you're incapacitated...

12:58.210 --> 13:02.380
It's time to accept your punishment
and show me whatcha got under there!

13:02.380 --> 13:03.460
Let's see...

13:03.460 --> 13:06.040
STOP!

13:10.830 --> 13:13.540
OMG, it's so tiny and adorable!

13:13.540 --> 13:15.000
That's hilarious!

13:15.000 --> 13:17.960
That's hilarious! That's hilarious!

13:17.960 --> 13:19.420
That's hilarious!

13:22.710 --> 13:23.830
We're under attack!

13:24.080 --> 13:26.830
And Miss Kyouka and the others
are still gone...

13:28.790 --> 13:30.000
The barrier...!

13:30.000 --> 13:32.080
You wait here, Mr. Caretaker.

13:32.330 --> 13:33.040
Hey!

13:33.040 --> 13:35.880
Guys are too wimpy.
Be good and stay put.

13:39.670 --> 13:43.210
Overpowering us with your size?
Not a bad strategy.

13:43.210 --> 13:45.710
Unfortunately, I'VE got the upper hand.

13:45.710 --> 13:48.380
Have a taste of my Peach ability...

13:50.380 --> 13:52.290
<b>PARADIGM</b>

13:50.380 --> 13:52.290
<b>SHIFT</b>

13:50.500 --> 13:52.330
Paradigm Shift!

13:55.040 --> 13:56.080
She's huge!

14:00.040 --> 14:02.960
<b>Milk</b>

14:00.040 --> 14:02.960
<b>Life</b>

14:16.750 --> 14:18.380
Is that all ya got?

14:18.380 --> 14:19.580
Take this!

14:23.920 --> 14:24.880
Wha-?!

14:25.330 --> 14:27.330
And... whoosh!

14:30.710 --> 14:31.960
Bam!

14:31.960 --> 14:33.330
Followed by...

14:33.330 --> 14:35.330
another kick!

14:39.000 --> 14:40.500
That was awesome!

14:42.000 --> 14:46.460
Man, turning into a giant sure is exhausting...

14:46.460 --> 14:47.920
Shushu, behind you!

14:47.920 --> 14:48.750
Huh?

14:52.290 --> 14:54.580
So there was another one hiding nearby...

14:54.580 --> 14:55.710
Sneaky...

15:03.250 --> 15:05.380
Always keepin' me on my toes!

15:13.880 --> 15:16.380
If I don't finish this quick,
things could get hairy...

15:19.380 --> 15:20.790
Paradigm Shift!

15:22.130 --> 15:22.750
Huh?

15:24.040 --> 15:24.960
What?

15:25.710 --> 15:26.580
Oh crap!

15:28.080 --> 15:29.040
Shushu!

15:35.540 --> 15:37.540
It looks like she's in real trouble!

15:37.880 --> 15:41.580
I want to transform,
but without Miss Kyouka, it's impossible!

15:43.250 --> 15:45.960
There must be SOMETHING I can do to help!

15:48.580 --> 15:52.420
I transformed when my lips touched
Miss Kyouka's hand...

15:54.920 --> 15:56.130
So by that logic...

15:59.960 --> 16:04.290
if I kiss something that belongs to her,
I should be able to transform, right?!

16:09.210 --> 16:11.170
Can't do it.

16:11.170 --> 16:12.920
But I'm on the right track!

16:12.920 --> 16:15.380
I need something
that provokes a stronger reaction!

16:21.250 --> 16:22.710
Please forgive me!

16:29.000 --> 16:30.960
It worked for a second there!

16:30.960 --> 16:32.420
If her shirt does a better job...

16:36.790 --> 16:41.540
Oh god, what does this say
about me as a person?

16:48.130 --> 16:49.630
There's no time to be indecisive!

16:49.880 --> 16:52.580
I want to be a hero!
I have to ACT!

16:52.830 --> 16:56.330
And if licking her boots
makes my dream come true, then I'm in!

17:02.000 --> 17:03.750
Eat this!

17:08.080 --> 17:11.420
Maybe I got carried away,
whipping out the jumbo size like that.

17:11.420 --> 17:13.130
Bad habit of mine...

17:13.580 --> 17:16.580
Probably going to shrink back to normal soon.

17:24.750 --> 17:28.210
Y-you only transformed halfway?!
That's a first!

17:28.210 --> 17:30.000
Still, I've gotta try!

17:30.000 --> 17:31.170
Hold it still!

17:34.580 --> 17:35.540
C'mere!

17:35.540 --> 17:37.920
TAKE THIS!

17:43.670 --> 17:44.750
Whoa...

17:47.000 --> 17:49.130
I... did it...

17:49.130 --> 17:52.130
Too late... I'm out of time.

17:52.130 --> 17:54.580
My body... won't move...

17:58.210 --> 17:59.040
Huh?

17:59.040 --> 17:59.960
Oof!

18:00.420 --> 18:02.290
H-hold on, this isn't...!

18:02.290 --> 18:04.380
Y-you saved my life, but...!

18:04.830 --> 18:07.830
I can't... I'm stuck!

18:10.580 --> 18:13.630
Forcing a transformation?
That's a little over the top.

18:13.630 --> 18:18.040
I did it 'cause of what you said.
"Guys are too wimpy. Be good and stay put."

18:18.040 --> 18:19.880
I wanted to prove you wrong.

18:25.920 --> 18:27.750
OH MY GOD!

18:28.790 --> 18:30.500
I was naked when I transformed!

18:30.500 --> 18:32.170
Th-this isn't what it looks like!

18:32.170 --> 18:34.250
He gets excited whenever I transform!

18:34.630 --> 18:36.170
Calm down! This isn't the time!

18:36.170 --> 18:38.420
Please, I'm begging you!

18:40.250 --> 18:43.830
I-it's... kinda impressive...

18:44.960 --> 18:46.790
Ouch, ow-ow-ow!

18:46.790 --> 18:49.830
Miss Kyouka, please be gentle with me!

18:49.830 --> 18:51.250
Just lie still.

18:51.250 --> 18:54.040
Out of commission
after a few minutes in combat?

18:54.040 --> 18:55.380
How pitiful.

18:55.380 --> 18:56.710
Oh, shut up!

18:56.960 --> 19:01.040
Um, shouldn't we fix the cracks
in the barrier around the dorm?

19:01.040 --> 19:02.420
No need to worry.

19:02.630 --> 19:04.420
The barriers protecting important locations

19:04.420 --> 19:08.040
such as our dormitory and the groves where
Peaches grow have special properties.

19:08.040 --> 19:11.130
So long as the damage is minor,
it will repair itself before long.

19:11.750 --> 19:14.960
Oh, it was the same then, too...

19:18.040 --> 19:19.830
But more importantly...

19:19.830 --> 19:20.960
quit squirming!

19:20.960 --> 19:22.580
Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!

19:23.170 --> 19:27.290
Th-this is the reward I get
for forcing myself to transform?!

19:27.500 --> 19:30.250
Shushu, no more slaying Shuuki for kicks.

19:30.710 --> 19:34.420
Underestimating your opponent
is how you end up in a body bag.

19:34.830 --> 19:36.500
Yes, ma'am. I should've known better.

19:36.500 --> 19:40.000
You can thank Yuuki by assisting him
with his household duties.

19:40.000 --> 19:41.080
Understood.

19:43.540 --> 19:44.670
Ouch...

19:46.540 --> 19:48.080
Hey! What are you doing?!

19:48.080 --> 19:50.500
Asserting dominance as your master.

19:50.500 --> 19:54.330
You've got me even more curious about guys
than I was before!

19:54.330 --> 19:56.460
So let's keep our arrangement.

19:56.460 --> 19:59.130
How'd you get the perfect photo?!

20:00.420 --> 20:02.500
Welp, till next time, Mr. Caretaker!

20:02.500 --> 20:03.710
W-wait!

20:04.880 --> 20:07.920
She's got too many
incriminating photos of me now...

20:07.920 --> 20:09.920
I can't talk my way out anymore...

20:09.920 --> 20:12.540
Will I ever be free?!

20:15.630 --> 20:18.540
I won't give you up, Yukki...

20:30.040 --> 20:31.170
Go ahead without me!

20:33.040 --> 20:35.000
Inform the commander ASAP!

20:35.000 --> 20:36.000
Roger that!

20:38.710 --> 20:40.500
That's no ordinary Shuuki-

20:44.040 --> 20:45.540
Yuna! Kaoru!

20:59.210 --> 21:00.460
No, don't eat her.

21:20.040 --> 21:22.000
I knew I felt it...

21:22.000 --> 21:24.460
Uh-huh, I'm positive!

21:24.460 --> 21:27.000
I'd know his presence anywhere!

21:30.080 --> 21:32.080
Yuuki's somewhere in Mato...

21:32.500 --> 21:35.130
So I'd better go pay him a visit!

23:11.040 --> 23:13.880
<b>TEACH US! NEI-SENPAI!</b>

23:11.380 --> 23:13.170
"Teach Us! Nei-senpai!"

23:13.170 --> 23:14.170
Okey-dokey!

23:13.880 --> 23:17.630
<b>PARADIGM SHIFT</b>

23:14.170 --> 23:17.670
Let's talk about Miss Shushu's
Peach ability: Paradigm Shift!

23:17.670 --> 23:20.420
With this ability,
she can alter the size of her body at will.

23:20.420 --> 23:21.580
But not just her body.

23:21.580 --> 23:24.210
She can also change the size
of the clothes she's wearing,

23:24.210 --> 23:26.170
or even simple objects, simultaneously!

23:26.330 --> 23:28.380
That must come in handy
when moving to a new house!

23:28.380 --> 23:30.540
By the way, the Demon Defense Force's dorm
has its own Wi-Fi.

23:30.540 --> 23:34.040
Miss Shushu spends a lot of time
playing online multiplayer games in her room.

23:34.040 --> 23:36.080
She lets Nei join in sometimes, too!

23:36.420 --> 23:37.540
Anyways, next time:

23:37.540 --> 23:39.210
"Encounter, Kyouka, Rampage"

23:37.540 --> 23:41.000
<b>ENCOUNTER,</b>

23:37.540 --> 23:41.000
<b>KYOUKA,</b>

23:37.540 --> 23:41.000
<b>RAMPAGE</b>

23:39.210 --> 23:41.040
Thanks for watching!
